==Battleground==
*4 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Moe Uzumasa & Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

